    "description": "Shown when discovery has been listening a while with no answer. Names both causes the user can act on rather than implying the network is broken."
  },

  "beamNothingToSend": "{count, plural, one{That wallpaper could not be read or fetched} other{None of those could be read or fetched}}",
  "@beamNothingToSend": {
    "description": "Shown when every wallpaper in a beam failed to resolve to bytes \u2014 offline while fetching an undownloaded one, or downloads whose files have since gone. Not 'not downloaded yet': an undownloaded wallpaper is fetched on the way out, so that is no longer a reason to fail.",
