  "settingsVaultEditHelp": "A dot is added for you, so \"stash\" becomes \".stash\". Letters, digits, spaces, _ and - only.",
  "@settingsVaultEditHelp": {
    "description": "Helper text under the vault name field. Names the two rules a typed value can break, so an invalid entry is explainable before it is rejected."
