  "settingsVaultEditNote": "The dot keeps the folder out of a file manager's listing until hidden files are turned on. That is concealment, not a lock — a card reads in any other device. tela still shows these images in the private library, behind the app-lock.",
  "@settingsVaultEditNote": {
    "description": "The honest limit of the feature, said where the user is deciding about it. It must not be oversold: FLAG_SECURE and the app-lock are the real protections, and the reassurance that the images are still listed in-app is what stops 'hidden' reading as 'gone'."
